pan></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Borewell Submersible Pump</h1>\n<p>Borewell submersible pump for deep well has perfect design and reasonable structure, which has low noise and long lifetime, no water pollution and is widely used for deep well, farmland irrigation, spray irrigation, urban and rural industry enterprise and drainage, etc....</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52165887\"/></p><p><strong>borewell submersible pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241126145872915.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>Borewell submersible pump for deep well has perfect design and reasonable structure, which has low noise and long lifetime, no water pollution and is widely used for deep well, farmland irrigation, spray irrigation, urban and rural industry enterprise and drainage, etc.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (specification)</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"62\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"64\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Head(</strong><strong>m</strong><strong>)</strong></p></td><td width=\"83\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Capacity(</strong><strong>m³/h</strong><strong>)</strong></p></td><td width=\"64\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Power(hp)</strong></p></td><td width=\"82\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Voltage(v)</strong></p></td><td width=\"135\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Temperature(</strong><strong>℃</strong><strong>)</strong></p></td><td width=\"64\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Material</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"62\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">6SRm18</p></td><td width=\"64\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1-366</p></td><td width=\"83\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0-33</p></td><td width=\"64\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">4-30</p></td><td width=\"82\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">220-240v/380v-415v</p></td><td width=\"135\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">up to 35Cº</p></td><td width=\"64\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">stainless steel</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241128086299496.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241126102713177.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Copper Motor<br/>      <img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241129384453021.jpg\"/> <br/>\n      ·100% copper wire<br/>\n      ·Lower temperature and longer    lifespan for the motor</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Mechanical Seal<br/>      <img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241129506247567.jpg\"/> <br/>\n      ·Super-high precision Carborundum Graphite mechanical seal<br/>\n      ·Oil, water and sand proof.</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Control Box<br/>      <img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241129592653959.jpg\"/> <br/>\n      ·Keep pump constant water pressure without motor    overheated or overloaded flexibly<br/>\n      ·Fire-resistant material casing</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Rotor Shaft<br/>      <img alt=\"image016(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241130094389774.jpg\"/></p><p> </p><p>·Super-high precision machine procedure<br/>\n        ·Smooth shaft surface, reduce the loss of energy loss    and mechanical seal abrasion</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Features</strong></p><p>1.  High Energy Efficiency, motor efficiency is higher about 10-20% than common motors.   solar </p><p>2. Small size, light weight</p><p>3. Multifunctions and Auto-protecting</p><p>4. DC Energy multi power supplies</p><p>5. Constant speed synchronous operation, flow and head keep same</p><p><strong>5. Product Application</strong></p><p>For water supply from wells or reservoirs</p><p>For domestic use, civil and industrial applications</p><p>For garden use and irrigation</p><p><img alt=\"image018(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241131211671909.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. Company Information</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image020(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241131519607833.jpg\"/></strong></p><p>Taizhou Jiadi pump industry Co., Ltd. is an enterprise of development, production, sales, service as one of the enterprises of valve and pump products. With strong sales network and service system, our products get the initiative in the fierce competition of the market. Highly sophisticated engineering experience and State of the art manufacturing process lead to the world class quality and its consistency.</p><p>Size: 2\", 2.5\", 3\", 3.5\", 4\", 5\", and 6\"</p><p>Voltage: 220V/380V/50Hz</p><p>110V/220V/380V/60Hz</p><p>Power: 0.18kW - 22kW</p><p>Capacity: 0.5m3/h – 60m3/h</p><p>Series: QJ, SR, SP, SK, QGDA, EGDA, EGD, QG, QDX, VSM</p><p>Fluid: clean water, dirty water and thick liquid.</p><p><strong>7. Product Certification</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240909571261840.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO14001</td><td align=\"center\